<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.2001 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.2001 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.2001 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday, up from 75.2500 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     March 17		March 14</p>
<p> High			     75.2299		 75.5000</p>
<p> Low				75.1950		 75.1400</p>
<p> Open			     75.2205		 75.2001</p>
<p> Close			    75.2001		 75.2500</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    5.605		   2.305</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 March 17		March 14</p>
<p> High			     44.5900		 44.0001</p>
<p> Low				44.3500		 44.0001</p>
<p> Open			     44.4000		 44.0001</p>
<p> Close			    44.5200		 44.0001</p>
<p> Volume (DM million)	   0.135		   0.005</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
